    "The proposed side dormers, due to their design, form, siting and bulk when combined with the crown roof extension, would appear visually intrusive, overly dominant, and incongruous in relation to the subject property and the immediate street scene. The proposal is therefore contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies D4 and D5 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD13 and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
